'''Zenyatta''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Tactician|Tactician]] [[Roles#Support|Support]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. He is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Zenyatta HS.mp4|left|thumb|Hero Selection Screen]] Zenyatta calls upon orbs of harmony and discord to heal his teammates and weaken his opponents, all while pursuing a transcendent state of immunity to damage.

