===Development===
[[File:Early zenyatta.png|thumb|Early Zenyatta concept art]]
*Sources deviate for the source of Zenyatta. According to a GamesCom panel in 2015, the idea for him came from a piece of omnic concept art.<ref>2015-08-08, [http://overwatch.blizzpro.com/2015/08/08/gamescom-livestream-panel-w-the-devs/ GAMESCOM LIVESTREAM PANEL W/ THE DEVS]. ''Blizzpro'', accessed on 2015-08-22</ref> According to ''[[Forging Worlds: Stories Behind the Art of Blizzard Entertainment]]'', Zenyatta was developed first, and the idea for omnics came later.<ref name = "ForgingWorlds">''[[Forging Worlds: Stories Behind the Art of Blizzard Entertainment]]''</ref>
**Further according to this account, the idea for Zenyatta came from Chris Metzen, who asked "what if there's a cybermonk?" in a meeting. The developers latched onto the idea.<ref name = "ForgingWorlds"/>
*Early designs for Zenyatta had him multi-limbed, referencing Eastern religious archtypes.<ref name="DesignEvolution">2022-11-28, [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Rxne0rbQ-A Overwatch 2: Ramattra's Design Evolution | Dev Update] ''Youtube'', accessed on 2022-11-27</ref>
*Zenyatta's age was originally given as 20, which did not sync with the timeframe of the Omnic Crisis. This was later changed to 33, establishing that he was built a few years before the war.
*Zenyatta is the first hero to have his total hit points changed (from 50 Health/100 Shield to 50 Health/150 Shield) through a patch in July 19, 2016. This was followed by [[D.Va]] in September 1, 2016.
*The relationship between Ramattra and Zenyatta will be fleshed out in Overwatch 2's PvE missions.<ref name = "RamattraZenyatta"/>

